=== 1. two nodes in one process ===
after 1s: p connected  q connected  
session spawned on p: listed under p 1, under q 0
session spawned on q: listed under p 0, under q 1
prompts p's process read: hello from p,again to p,
prompts q's process read: hello from q,again to q,
  node p: hooks on 127.0.0.1:62106, Claude dir $W/p/claude
  node q: hooks on 127.0.0.1:62107, Claude dir $W/q/claude
--- the hub restarts
after 1s: p connected  q connected  
=== 2. the same, q set to dial through its tailnet ===
after 20s: p connected  q offline  
--- the hub restarts
after 40s: p offline  q offline  
each node's link since the restart:
  before: p  1 registered with the hub;
  before: q  5 not on the tailnet yet;
  after: p 5 not on the tailnet yet;
  after: q 2 not on the tailnet yet;
